        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michelle Trachtenberg, Tim Fywell, Hadley Davis, Meg Cabot, Joan Cusack, Kim Cattrall, Hayden Panettiere\n- Films and TV works: Harriet the Spy, Inspector Gadget, EuroTrip, Ice Princess, Black Christmas, 17 Again, Cop Out, Weeds, Killing Kennedy\n\nFacts:\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in the film Harriet the Spy in 1996.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in the film Inspector Gadget in 1999.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in the film EuroTrip in 2004.\n- Ice Princess is a 2005 American figure-skating film.\n- Ice Princess was directed by Tim Fywell.\n- Ice Princess was written by Hadley Davis from a story by Meg Cabot and Hadley Davis.\n- Ice Princess stars Michelle Trachtenberg, Joan Cusack, Kim Cattrall, and Hayden Panettiere.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in the film Ice Princess in 2005.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in the film Black Christmas in 2006.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in the film 17 Again in 2009.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in Cop Out in 2010.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in Weeds in 2011.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in Killing Kennedy in 2013.",
